+A clean potted plant gives one small leaf sway when the resident performs its existing wave. Its eight visible leaves keep their individual roots at the original dx,-9 soil attachments. Pots, shadows, leaf paths, dirty foliage, fallen leaves and watering hints retain their original art. Each clean leaf gets an inner responsive group inside its existing translation and rotation. Shared leafShape callers keep their original unwrapped paths unless the optional response flag is set. There is no added UI, contact, reach, sound, dialogue, route, chore or save change.
