+Before production edits, 17 Room/resident tests produced 16 expected missing-response failures and one passing nonresponse guard. Exact red source bytes are archived. A copied fish-related test title was corrected afterward; no assertion changed. Static Vite SSR/Resvg comparisons covered plant and fish tank, three stages, four rotations and two raster widths. All 48 candidate pixel buffers and PNG files matched their pre-edit baselines. An isolated offline native probe checked 224 leaf roots at seven phases, eight roots and four outer rotations. Maximum attachment error was zero. This probe injected the class into candidate SVG and was a geometry experiment, not integrated app verification.
