+Production edits waited for B61 independent PASS and local checkpoint. Applied leaf source and CSS bytes match the pixel-compared candidate and root-probed CSS hashes. The first focused run passed 262 tests in nine files. The first build command used a nonexistent node_modules/npm path and failed before starting a build. The corrected repository npm run build command passed; the first error remains archived.
